 p9s │ ctx kind-demo │ ns all │ alpha · beta │ last audit 30s ago (alpha)    RO
─ Help ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 Navigation
   j k ↑ ↓     move
   pgup pgdn   page
   home end G  first / last
   enter       drill down (or describe when there is nothing to drill into)
   esc         clear filter, else back
   :           command mode (tab completes)
   /           filter: free text, or engine: mode: ns: kind: sev: name: terms
   0           all namespaces (clear the :ns scope)
   ?           this help
   ctrl+c :q   quit

 Views
   :overview         start view: health, top violators, enforcement candidates
   :pol [engine]     policies across engines
   :v [engine]       violations across engines ([ ] switch current / recent)
   :events           recent admission events (the recent tab of :v)
   :impact <policy>  what enforcing a policy would block (i on a policy row)
   :mut [engine]     mutations across engines
   :health           engine health: webhooks, controllers, audits, policies
   :ns [name|all]    scope every view to a namespace
   :ctx              kubeconfig contexts

 Keys
   d           describe
   y           YAML (Secret values are redacted)
   e           open the YAML in $EDITOR (read-only: changes are discarded)
   g           go to the source object
   c           copy kind/namespace/name of the row's object
   C           copy a kubectl get command for it
   N V A S     sort by name, violations, age, severity (again to reverse)
   o           :v grouped by owner ↔ flat list
   t           :v grouped by owner ↔ by --group-label
   [ ]         :v current tab (audit results) ↔ recent tab (admission events)
   i           enforcement impact of the policy on this row

 Engine views (also reached by drilling down)
